30.
RESOLUTION
— Supporting the adoption of a Vision Zero Policy to eliminate fatalities
and serious injuries that are a result of crashes on city streets within the City of Cheyenne
by 2040.
(SPONSOR - DR. ALDRICH)
Mr. Layboum moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Segrave. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
